    "Fetch supported EMS2 subject and role inventory endpoints separately from matrix definitions.",
    "Compare profile definitions, mappings, assignments, effective subject/action content, and unresolved data scope independently.",
    "Persist each account response and assessment immediately. Reconcile matched, missing, additional, failed, and unassessed counts.",
    "Exclude FMO from production denominators; show optional low-priority results separately."
