    "No pagination protocol appears in supplied files. Do not invent paging parameters; retain acquisition completeness limits.",
    "Capture URLs and dates do not prove a synchronized source/destination snapshot.",
    "HTTP 401,403,404,5xx, malformed JSON, timeout, TLS, and count mismatches must not become empty matching profiles.",
    "The UAT service-account collection embeds a PROD stored request and identical PROD response; it is not independent EMS2 UAT evidence."
